The GumboTreeBuilder and GumboTagSets files under
src/Campfire.Application/RichText/Html/Parsing are C# adaptations of
gumbo-parser/src/parser.c and insertion_mode.h. They use AngleSharp's
tokenizer and omit native parse errors, source locations, and parse flags.
The source comments identify this adaptation and its changes.
